<item><title>Morocco targets 50,000 defense-industry jobs and 65% export revenue by 2035</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-targets-50-000-defense-industry-jobs-and-65-export-680822/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-targets-50-000-defense-industry-jobs-and-65-export-680822/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The roadmap also sets a goal for local industry to meet about 40% of the armed forces’ and security agencies’ needs.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco opens 259-bed university hospital complex in Dakhla</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-opens-259-bed-university-hospital-complex-in-dakhla-6db5ba/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-opens-259-bed-university-hospital-complex-in-dakhla-6db5ba/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The facility combines 28 medical and surgical specialties with a health sciences university designed to accommodate up to 3,000 students.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:00:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-opens-259-bed-university-hospital-complex-in-dakhla-6db5ba/share.jpg" length="41509" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-opens-259-bed-university-hospital-complex-in-dakhla-6db5ba/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mohammed VI approves Morocco defence industry roadmap with two zones</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/mohammed-vi-approves-morocco-defence-industry-roadmap-with-04c5ca/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/mohammed-vi-approves-morocco-defence-industry-roadmap-with-04c5ca/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The plan sets out industrial sites in Benguérir and Benslimane and targets covering about 40% of armed forces and security bodies’ needs by 2035.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:06:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco mobilizes 2.5 billion dirhams for startups and AI</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-mobilizes-2-5-billion-dirhams-for-startups-and-ai-d2d267/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-mobilizes-2-5-billion-dirhams-for-startups-and-ai-d2d267/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Minister Ahmed Rahhou also outlined plans for two public AI assistants, first to be tested in administrations and public institutions.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:39:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco and Mauritania target 6 billion dirhams in trade by 2030</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-and-mauritania-target-6-billion-dirhams-in-trade-by-a70e6f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-and-mauritania-target-6-billion-dirhams-in-trade-by-a70e6f/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Their exchanges reached nearly 3.7 billion dirhams in 2025, up 15%, as Mauritania became Morocco’s second-largest African export market.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:26:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
